WEBVTT

00:13.388 --> 00:15.098
I ever tell you
about Rex Calabrese?

00:15.807 --> 00:17.017
Uh, no.

00:20.979 --> 00:22.856
He ran my neighborhood
when I was a kid.

00:24.357 --> 00:27.277
Had this gold Cadillac
with white leather seats.

00:29.237 --> 00:30.196
Beautiful.

00:31.072 --> 00:32.574
When it rolled down your street,
I mean,

00:32.574 --> 00:34.659
it felt like
your block was blessed.

00:35.910 --> 00:38.705
Rex's ride,
it wasn't just a car.

00:38.705 --> 00:40.582
It was a fuckin' chariot.

00:41.666 --> 00:44.294
Made a kid with a bum leg
feel like even he could be king.

00:48.590 --> 00:49.591
The end of an era.

00:52.594 --> 00:53.553
Come on.

00:54.137 --> 00:55.722
What about Sofia?

00:55.722 --> 00:57.098
- Now that she knows--
- Sofia?

00:57.599 --> 00:59.726
Chick's a thorn
without a prick, kid.

00:59.726 --> 01:01.519
We get our shrooms back,
she won't matter.

01:01.519 --> 01:02.729
Right.

01:04.272 --> 01:05.899
- Sorry, Oz.
- For what?

01:06.399 --> 01:07.734
For wrecking your chariot.

01:09.027 --> 01:10.445
I only got one shot at this.

01:11.279 --> 01:14.324
You know, I-I see that now.

01:14.324 --> 01:15.909
You came back, Vic.

01:17.077 --> 01:18.620
Put your ass on the line for me.

01:19.496 --> 01:21.331
A hundred Maseratis
couldn't replace that.

01:21.331 --> 01:23.500
Though this one came
pretty damn close.

01:24.459 --> 01:26.670
It's you and me now, kid.
Till the end.

01:26.670 --> 01:29.756
Ain't it time we got ourselves
some goddamn respect?

01:29.756 --> 01:31.091
Huh?

01:31.091 --> 01:32.300
Let's fucking go.

01:33.009 --> 01:34.094
I like that.

01:34.094 --> 01:35.804
Alright. Here's our ride.

01:45.230 --> 01:46.690
Welcome to the party, fellas!

01:46.690 --> 01:47.857
Oz, your fuckin' car.

01:47.857 --> 01:49.317
What are you gonna do?

01:49.317 --> 01:50.985
Only the good die young.

01:50.985 --> 01:53.613
So, listen. When I eat, you eat.

01:53.613 --> 01:54.989
That's how it's always been, right?

01:54.989 --> 01:56.408
- Yeah, 'course.
- Alright, good.

01:56.408 --> 01:58.034
Well, I got somethin'
beautiful going.

01:58.034 --> 01:59.911
A new drug. Homegrown.

01:59.911 --> 02:01.579
I was gonna cut you in on it,

02:01.579 --> 02:03.873
but fuckin' Maronis took it
off my plate before I could.

02:03.998 --> 02:05.000
So, how we getting it back?

02:05.792 --> 02:06.960
Whoa.

02:06.960 --> 02:08.461
Hey, listen.

02:08.461 --> 02:10.463
The Maronis got
a huge fuckin' blind spot

02:10.463 --> 02:12.132
just beggin' to be exploited.

02:12.132 --> 02:13.925
Come here, look at this.

02:15.510 --> 02:16.886
Yo, what up, fam?

02:16.886 --> 02:18.471
I'm getting a slick new
back piece

02:18.471 --> 02:19.848
from the Chicano
legend himself--

02:19.848 --> 02:21.141
Taj Maroni.

02:21.141 --> 02:22.684
This is the heir
to Sal's throne.

02:22.684 --> 02:25.270
...to tell all you
motherfuckers the Maronis

02:25.270 --> 02:27.522
are about to take back
what was taken from us.

02:27.522 --> 02:29.983
This stupid motherfucker,
he's just beggin' to be got.

02:44.831 --> 02:45.874
Hey!

02:45.874 --> 02:47.584
Yo, what the fuck?

02:47.584 --> 02:49.252
- Mikey!
- I got him!

02:51.046 --> 02:52.422
Don't you fuckin'--

02:53.423 --> 02:54.299
Stop!

03:04.726 --> 03:05.769
Hey. Hey.

03:05.769 --> 03:08.021
Hold still, you piece of shit.

03:08.021 --> 03:09.606
You are so fucked, man.

03:09.606 --> 03:12.067
You messed
with the wrong fuckin' family!

03:12.067 --> 03:15.195
My-My mother, my father,
they won't stand for this--

03:17.113 --> 03:18.448
That's what I'm countin' on.

03:40.887 --> 03:41.888
What do you want?

03:41.888 --> 03:43.139
I want what's mine.

03:44.599 --> 03:46.351
What your wife stole from me.

03:46.351 --> 03:48.311
I want my fuckin' shrooms.

03:48.311 --> 03:51.356
Our son is not a pawn.

03:51.356 --> 03:52.941
There is a code.

03:52.941 --> 03:54.109
Is that right?

03:54.109 --> 03:55.985
What, I take the wrong Maroni?
That it?

03:55.985 --> 03:57.529
You do not threaten my family.

03:57.529 --> 03:58.988
Jesus, Sal.

03:58.988 --> 04:00.115
Put your dick away.

04:00.824 --> 04:02.242
Don't forget who I got at home.

04:13.253 --> 04:16.631
We meet early, before sunrise,
for the exchange.

04:16.631 --> 04:18.466
Make sure my shrooms
are ready to go.

04:19.759 --> 04:21.886
And what do you say
we keep it nice and intimate?

04:21.886 --> 04:23.263
Just you, me, and Taj.

04:23.263 --> 04:25.557
No. My wife doesn't go alone.

04:25.557 --> 04:28.435
Fine. I'll let you
take one guard, Nadia.

04:28.935 --> 04:30.270
'Cause I'm a gentleman.

04:32.313 --> 04:33.148
Sal.

04:40.613 --> 04:41.865
Hey!

04:43.700 --> 04:46.828
Honor your end,
and Taj will be just fine.

04:49.831 --> 04:50.957
Now...

04:51.750 --> 04:52.959
we got a deal or what?

04:54.711 --> 04:55.837
All security officers

04:55.837 --> 04:58.381
report to administration
before the end of shift.

05:10.143 --> 05:11.478
Eleven o'clock.

05:11.478 --> 05:12.771
Red jacket.

05:15.607 --> 05:16.566
Breaking news.

05:16.566 --> 05:18.818
A tragedy at the home
of late mob boss

05:18.818 --> 05:21.112
- Carmine Falcone...
- Hey, come on!

05:21.112 --> 05:22.614
Some of us got places to be.

05:22.614 --> 05:24.824
...Sofia Falcone,
Carmine's daughter,

05:24.824 --> 05:28.328
is currently one of the only
confirmed survivors.

05:28.328 --> 05:30.830
GCPD has yet to release
any results

05:30.830 --> 05:33.083
of their still-early
investigation,

05:33.083 --> 05:36.711
but these deaths follow
a period of intense violence

05:36.711 --> 05:39.839
between the Falcone
and the Maroni crime families.

06:04.406 --> 06:05.573
Ms. Falcone?

06:08.368 --> 06:09.911
Please, I prefer Sofia.

06:10.495 --> 06:11.663
Police Chief Bock.

06:12.247 --> 06:13.915
Gotham City Police Department.

06:13.915 --> 06:15.041
Ms. Falcone!

06:16.626 --> 06:17.669
Can we...?

06:19.295 --> 06:20.213
Yeah.

06:24.259 --> 06:26.928
You said you remained
in the greenhouse all night.

06:27.762 --> 06:30.390
Gia and I, yes.
There was an argument

06:30.390 --> 06:32.767
between my Uncle Luca
and my cousin Johnny.

06:33.351 --> 06:35.603
Carla asked me
to take Gia outside...

06:37.188 --> 06:38.398
keep her away from it.

06:38.982 --> 06:40.400
What was the argument about?

06:43.403 --> 06:45.739
I only heard bits and pieces.

06:45.739 --> 06:48.450
Something about Luca's wife,
Tina.

06:50.035 --> 06:55.248
There were rumors
about an affair, but I...

06:56.958 --> 06:59.502
It wasn't a good situation
for a young girl to be in.

06:59.502 --> 07:01.880
Johnny Viti's
not among the dead.

07:03.131 --> 07:05.008
Any idea where
we might find him?

07:06.259 --> 07:07.427
I'm sorry, no.

07:09.596 --> 07:12.015
He must've left last night.

07:13.266 --> 07:15.643
I didn't come back inside
until this morning.

07:16.895 --> 07:18.188
And that's when I...

07:19.773 --> 07:20.982
saw the bodies.

07:21.691 --> 07:22.859
Excuse me.

07:23.860 --> 07:25.945
Awfully suspicious,
don't you think?

07:27.155 --> 07:30.658
Prominent crime family in Gotham
wiped out by a gas leak?

07:36.873 --> 07:39.334
Is that a question
you'd like me to answer?

07:41.419 --> 07:42.295
Tell me,

07:43.088 --> 07:44.673
is it common
for the chief of police

07:44.673 --> 07:46.925
to respond to house calls?

07:47.967 --> 07:49.594
We are quite a ways
from the city.

07:49.594 --> 07:52.013
I hope you didn't come
to my home

07:52.013 --> 07:54.724
to throw my family's death
in my face.

07:54.724 --> 07:56.976
It's a new era in Gotham,
Ms. Falcone.

07:56.976 --> 07:58.561
The mayor-elect's got a mandate

07:58.561 --> 08:00.605
to put an end
to the scum of this city.

08:00.605 --> 08:03.191
So you're here to see it
for yourself.

08:07.487 --> 08:10.365
And I suppose you and your boys
are gonna go for beers later?

08:11.074 --> 08:12.242
To celebrate?

08:13.243 --> 08:16.079
Maybe swap photos
of my dead relatives?

08:17.539 --> 08:19.791
Or are you going to sell those
to the Gazette

08:20.500 --> 08:22.919
to make up
for all the lost kickbacks?

08:27.465 --> 08:29.050
We're doing our due diligence.

08:30.719 --> 08:32.846
If you hear from Johnny Viti,
give us a call.

08:34.305 --> 08:35.598
Sorry for your loss.

08:54.784 --> 08:56.578
The cops are looking
for you, Johnny.

08:58.747 --> 09:01.750
Although I get the sense they'd
rather find you dead than alive.

09:05.420 --> 09:06.588
You're not looking too good.

09:18.308 --> 09:19.684
The fuck is wrong with you?

09:21.061 --> 09:22.437
You're fucking sick.

09:23.063 --> 09:25.398
What kind of person kills
their own fuckin' family?

09:26.775 --> 09:28.526
I need untraceable cash.

09:29.736 --> 09:32.781
I know that my father would have
kept it somewhere close.

09:33.448 --> 09:35.575
And all you gotta do is show me.

09:36.201 --> 09:38.244
- And then I'll let you go.
- Right.

09:40.080 --> 09:41.623
You think I'm a fuckin' idiot?

09:42.916 --> 09:44.376
The second I do what you want,

09:44.376 --> 09:45.752
you fucking kill me.

09:47.921 --> 09:49.798
So just fuckin' do it already.

09:50.340 --> 09:52.092
Please, Johnny.

09:53.885 --> 09:55.303
You're not that brave.

09:56.846 --> 10:00.100
But if you need more time
to think, you got it.

10:03.019 --> 10:05.480
Although you should know,
it gets very cold down here.

10:06.189 --> 10:08.233
And with the work
that it takes your body

10:08.942 --> 10:11.486
to keep your organs alive...

10:13.905 --> 10:14.989
you won't last long.

10:14.989 --> 10:16.074
Wait!

10:18.660 --> 10:20.745
Several members
of the Falcone family

10:20.745 --> 10:23.039
are still reported missing,
including Johnny Viti...

10:23.039 --> 10:24.749
She knows
you killed her brother,

10:24.749 --> 10:26.710
and now she's gassed
her entire family.

10:26.710 --> 10:27.794
Doll, let's relax.

10:27.794 --> 10:30.171
Don't tell me to relax.

10:30.171 --> 10:31.798
I was your alibi, Oz.

10:31.798 --> 10:33.008
You made me that.

10:33.008 --> 10:34.759
Keep your voice down, alright?

10:34.759 --> 10:36.553
The guys don't know
all the details.

10:36.553 --> 10:38.680
You got too many plates
spinning.

10:38.680 --> 10:40.807
Listen, sweetheart, I know
you can't see it right now,

10:40.807 --> 10:42.892
but all this shit goin' down,
it's a good thing.

10:43.518 --> 10:46.229
I put it all in motion.
Luca, the Family...

10:46.229 --> 10:48.523
Sofia just took the bait,
that's all.

10:48.523 --> 10:50.817
Baby, do you even know when
you're full of shit anymore?

10:50.817 --> 10:52.694
- Huh?
- Me and the girls.

10:52.694 --> 10:54.571
You dangled us in front of her.

10:54.571 --> 10:57.240
- I didn't dangle you.
- You think it's a good thing?

10:57.240 --> 11:00.702
The Hangman knowing
their names, their faces...

11:01.411 --> 11:03.079
She's gunning for us now.

11:04.039 --> 11:06.166
While Taj Maroni sits
in my apartment.

11:06.166 --> 11:09.836
The fuck was I supposed to do?
They stole my shit.

11:09.836 --> 11:11.087
Come on, doll.

11:11.087 --> 11:14.632
Nothing's gonna happen to you.
I won't let it.

11:15.216 --> 11:17.886
All I'm askin' is for you to
hang tight just a little longer.

11:17.886 --> 11:18.928
That's it.

11:19.804 --> 11:22.515
And then it's you and me
on top of the world, baby.

11:22.515 --> 11:24.267
I need you to fix this.

11:24.267 --> 11:26.144
That's what I do. I fix things.

11:26.144 --> 11:28.271
Don't I fix things? Huh?

11:28.271 --> 11:31.566
Currently, there is no threat
to rescue workers...

11:31.566 --> 11:33.068
That's all I ever fuckin' do.

11:37.113 --> 11:39.366
As of now,
GCPD has yet to confirm

11:39.366 --> 11:42.285
- the total deceased...
- Members of Falcone family dead.

11:42.285 --> 11:44.079
Boo-hoo-hoo. Turn that shit off.

11:45.538 --> 11:46.706
Jesus fucking Christ.

11:47.791 --> 11:50.627
Look, I know this shit's grim,
all right,

11:50.627 --> 11:52.921
but none of those fucks
were friends of ours.

11:53.421 --> 11:54.631
They never made us.

11:55.840 --> 11:58.343
Luca Falcone didn't even know
your fuckin' names.

12:00.178 --> 12:01.846
So who ya missing?

12:01.846 --> 12:04.057
That skinny little pussy,
Johnny Viti?

12:04.933 --> 12:05.809
Milos?

12:06.768 --> 12:08.603
Guy wore lifts in his shoes.
We all knew it.

12:09.938 --> 12:11.481
The way I see it,

12:11.481 --> 12:13.108
Sofia done us a favor.

12:14.109 --> 12:17.404
One family down, one to go.

12:17.404 --> 12:19.906
Now, let's get back
what belongs to us, alright?

12:19.906 --> 12:21.491
- All right.
- Get the fuck outta here.

12:21.491 --> 12:23.368
- Let's go, brother.
- Let's do it.

12:23.368 --> 12:24.536
Hey, come on.

12:25.537 --> 12:26.705
You. Come here.

12:27.997 --> 12:28.915
Come on.

12:28.915 --> 12:30.375
I'm gonna need you with my ma.

12:30.500 --> 12:32.335
Oz, I thought I'd...

12:33.878 --> 12:35.296
be with you and the guys.

12:35.964 --> 12:36.840
I'm ready. I swear--

12:36.840 --> 12:38.758
I know you wanna get
in the fight, kid, but...

12:38.758 --> 12:40.260
I ain't got no one else
I can trust.

12:40.260 --> 12:42.012
And look, Sofia's gonna come
for us.

12:42.012 --> 12:43.346
Whether it's today or tomorrow,

12:43.346 --> 12:46.182
she's gonna do whatever the fuck
it takes, and I can't have--

12:46.182 --> 12:49.394
I mean, my ma, she's,
you know...

12:50.311 --> 12:51.813
She's what keeps me good.

12:52.814 --> 12:54.149
I gotta know she's alright.

12:54.149 --> 12:55.442
Yeah. Done.

12:55.442 --> 12:58.737
I'm gonna...
I'll-I'll take care of her.

12:59.487 --> 13:00.321
I promise.

13:02.782 --> 13:04.409
Hold still. Stop squirming.

13:04.409 --> 13:05.326
Get him up.

13:11.666 --> 13:12.959
Let's get you home.

13:30.143 --> 13:31.686
How you doing, Johnny?

13:33.772 --> 13:36.024
You ready to head back
to the house?

13:36.775 --> 13:40.362
Maybe warm yourself
by a nice fire,

13:40.987 --> 13:43.114
light an expensive cigar?

13:47.577 --> 13:48.578
Or...

13:50.038 --> 13:52.165
do you want to die
down here in the dark,

13:52.165 --> 13:53.625
with all the greats?

13:57.671 --> 14:00.006
I can't guarantee
you'll get one of these...

14:00.715 --> 14:03.009
gold nameplates,
but I'm sure we can find you

14:03.009 --> 14:05.303
a very nice unmarked hole
somewhere.

14:07.889 --> 14:09.891
She-She was gonna leave him,
you know...

14:11.559 --> 14:12.894
The night Isabella died.

14:13.978 --> 14:15.522
She was gonna leave Carmine.

14:16.439 --> 14:18.066
Don't talk about my mother.

14:18.066 --> 14:19.609
You remember, don't you?

14:19.609 --> 14:21.152
You were all packed
and ready to go.

14:21.152 --> 14:23.363
She was gonna take you
and your brother on a trip.

14:25.281 --> 14:26.408
That's what she told you.

14:28.159 --> 14:29.828
She was my cousin.

14:29.828 --> 14:30.870
I loved her.

14:30.870 --> 14:32.372
She asked for my help.

14:33.081 --> 14:36.292
I had a fucking car waiting
a few blocks down the road,

14:36.292 --> 14:38.044
and she never fuckin' showed.

14:39.546 --> 14:43.258
You are a desperate
fucking liar.

14:43.258 --> 14:44.342
I swear.

14:45.760 --> 14:47.387
I got no reason to lie anymore!

14:53.268 --> 14:55.061
I ain't tryin' to push
on a bruise, Sofia.

14:57.480 --> 14:59.357
She was with Carmine
'cause of me.

15:00.400 --> 15:01.609
You knew that, right?

15:02.360 --> 15:03.445
I introduced them.

15:05.405 --> 15:06.740
And your father...

15:06.740 --> 15:08.867
He was smitten
right outta the gate.

15:09.868 --> 15:12.162
God, she was beautiful,
your mom.

15:14.539 --> 15:16.291
She was so beautiful.

15:18.251 --> 15:20.086
She had that laugh.
When you got her going,

15:20.086 --> 15:21.338
it'd knock you out.

15:25.800 --> 15:28.261
She couldn't take it anymore
being his wife.

15:29.721 --> 15:31.431
She just fucking
couldn't take it.

15:33.224 --> 15:37.187
She tried to leave once before,
but she came right back.

15:38.772 --> 15:41.649
She came right back
'cause of you fucking kids.

15:42.734 --> 15:44.235
Would've been
so much easier for her

15:44.235 --> 15:45.862
if it weren't
for the two of you.

15:55.622 --> 15:58.583
I wi... Sometimes, I wish...

16:00.919 --> 16:01.878
It's done.

16:03.421 --> 16:05.256
What's done is...

16:05.256 --> 16:07.300
What's done is done.
What he did is done.

16:10.470 --> 16:12.389
But you kept on working for him.

16:13.640 --> 16:14.808
You loved her so much,

16:14.808 --> 16:17.102
you were his underboss
for years.

16:19.020 --> 16:20.146
Yeah.

16:22.399 --> 16:23.483
Yeah.

16:25.944 --> 16:28.863
But you need me now, Sofia.
You need me.

16:29.989 --> 16:32.742
You wanna be boss?
You wanna win this war?

16:32.742 --> 16:35.412
Then money's not enough.
You need respect.

16:35.412 --> 16:37.914
You need soldiers
who want to fight for you.

16:37.914 --> 16:40.375
You go it alone out there,
you're not gonna last a day.

16:40.917 --> 16:42.627
I can get you that respect.

16:43.461 --> 16:45.005
I couldn't help your mother.

16:47.007 --> 16:47.966
Let me help you.

16:52.554 --> 16:53.471
Come on.

16:59.602 --> 17:00.812
Mrs. Cobb?

17:00.812 --> 17:02.272
What are you gonna do?

17:02.272 --> 17:04.065
Shoot a six-year-old kid...

17:04.065 --> 17:05.650
It's...

17:09.487 --> 17:11.948
Mrs. Cobb, it's... it's Victor.

17:16.119 --> 17:16.953
Francis?

17:31.593 --> 17:33.386
Oh my God...

17:55.033 --> 17:56.117
Mrs. Cobb?

17:57.118 --> 17:58.161
Hey.

17:58.787 --> 18:00.997
- Hi.
- Hey. There you are.

18:03.083 --> 18:04.626
Why are you way over there?

18:04.626 --> 18:06.336
Come here, sweetheart.

18:07.671 --> 18:08.713
Come here.

18:10.507 --> 18:11.883
Look what I found.

18:12.634 --> 18:14.094
You remember this?

18:15.804 --> 18:17.472
No. No, ma'am.

18:17.472 --> 18:19.933
It's your glove
from Little League.

18:19.933 --> 18:22.644
- Look how small--
- I'm sorry. I'm...

18:22.644 --> 18:24.437
I'm V...

18:25.397 --> 18:27.524
I'm V-Victor.

18:27.524 --> 18:28.650
I'm Victor.

18:29.651 --> 18:31.903
I-I work with Oz.

18:31.903 --> 18:34.322
Oswald... Right? Your son?

18:34.322 --> 18:37.701
He-He s-sent me here
to ch-check up on you.

18:37.701 --> 18:39.285
I know who you are.

18:40.829 --> 18:43.415
I tell my son to visit more,
so he sends strangers.

18:45.667 --> 18:46.584
I get it.

18:49.629 --> 18:51.881
Well, help me up
for Christ's sake.

18:57.303 --> 18:59.514
Okay, here we go.

18:59.514 --> 19:00.432
Whoa, whoa.

19:01.641 --> 19:02.726
What is this?

19:02.726 --> 19:04.227
What? I don't know.

19:04.811 --> 19:06.563
Oh, shit. Well...

19:06.563 --> 19:07.564
I fell.

19:09.232 --> 19:10.692
Maybe I was pushed.

19:15.655 --> 19:16.781
So...

19:18.825 --> 19:20.326
Nurse boy.

19:20.326 --> 19:22.912
What's Oswald doin' that's
more important than me? Huh?

19:22.912 --> 19:24.164
He's making a move...

19:26.124 --> 19:27.500
against the Maronis.

19:28.043 --> 19:30.170
Maronis?

19:30.170 --> 19:32.213
No, baby, you got it backwards.

19:32.213 --> 19:34.799
He's workin' them to get
at the Falcones.

19:34.799 --> 19:36.217
They're the bigger fish.

19:38.428 --> 19:39.596
They're all dead.

19:42.515 --> 19:44.642
Was it him? Did Oswald kill 'em?

19:48.396 --> 19:49.439
Yeah.

19:50.523 --> 19:51.691
Don't lie to me.

19:52.525 --> 19:53.693
You're bad at it.

19:54.861 --> 19:55.904
It's the truth.

19:58.948 --> 19:59.866
Oz...

20:01.284 --> 20:03.036
Oz pulled this off.

20:03.036 --> 20:05.455
That's why I'm here right now,
to... to...

20:05.455 --> 20:08.875
m-make sure that you're safe

20:08.875 --> 20:10.335
while this is all going down.

20:11.211 --> 20:12.545
Finally.

20:13.254 --> 20:14.547
Okay, then.

20:14.547 --> 20:15.590
So...

20:16.549 --> 20:18.885
he's gonna need
my help then, right?

20:20.387 --> 20:23.682
Okay, let's go!
Let's do this! Let's...

20:46.955 --> 20:48.665
This is from Oz, motherfucker.

21:19.988 --> 21:21.489
Nadia, Nadia, Nadia.

21:22.240 --> 21:23.366
Always a pleasure.

21:24.701 --> 21:26.453
My son. Now.

21:27.245 --> 21:29.873
Straight to business, huh?
You know, I respect that.

21:31.875 --> 21:32.876
Bruno.

21:36.838 --> 21:37.881
C'mere.

21:39.549 --> 21:41.801
Jesus. Stop fuckin' shakin'.

21:47.515 --> 21:49.100
What have you done to him?

21:49.100 --> 21:52.062
He's fine. Picture of health.

21:52.062 --> 21:54.439
Remove the tape.
I want to hear it from him.

21:55.065 --> 21:57.108
I'm doing you a solid.
Your son's a talker.

21:57.108 --> 21:58.610
We all want this over quick.

21:58.610 --> 22:02.072
Just lemme see the shrooms,
and we'll be on our way.

22:04.908 --> 22:06.701
Bruno. Check the product.

22:18.922 --> 22:19.839
Calm down.

22:19.839 --> 22:21.966
Relax. Jesus Christ.

22:23.134 --> 22:24.427
We're good.

22:24.427 --> 22:26.221
Alright, Nadia.

22:26.221 --> 22:28.056
My friend Bruno,
he's gonna get in that truck--

22:28.056 --> 22:29.808
That truck stays put...

22:31.434 --> 22:32.686
until my son is released.

22:32.686 --> 22:34.312
Relax, Nadia.

22:34.312 --> 22:35.438
I know.

22:38.441 --> 22:39.526
Go to Mama.

22:51.913 --> 22:53.164
So sorry.

22:54.708 --> 22:55.667
Fuck!

23:15.437 --> 23:16.479
- Baby...
- Mom.

23:18.106 --> 23:18.982
Oh, no.

23:18.982 --> 23:20.191
Oh, shit!

23:48.678 --> 23:50.138
Fuck! The shrooms!

23:50.138 --> 23:51.765
Get in the truck!

23:54.559 --> 23:55.685
Go, go, go!

24:23.630 --> 24:25.590
Shit, what happened?
You alright?

24:25.590 --> 24:27.425
It was fucked up, man.

24:27.425 --> 24:29.969
They tried to screw us.
Oz lit 'em up...

24:33.640 --> 24:35.475
No, no, no.

24:35.475 --> 24:36.393
No!

24:37.602 --> 24:38.853
No, no, no...

24:40.438 --> 24:41.272
No.

24:42.440 --> 24:43.900
No!

24:45.610 --> 24:46.986
Fuckin' dead.

24:46.986 --> 24:47.904
Fuck.

24:48.446 --> 24:49.864
They're all fuckin' dead!

24:53.034 --> 24:53.910
That's it?!

24:53.910 --> 24:55.620
Oz? What-What's the matter?

24:55.620 --> 24:58.248
They're ruined.
We got two buckets.

24:58.790 --> 24:59.708
That's fuckin' it!

24:59.708 --> 25:01.459
The rest are fucked!

25:01.459 --> 25:04.421
You don't build a goddamn empire
with two fuckin' buckets!

25:04.421 --> 25:06.256
- We can't get more?
- More?

25:06.256 --> 25:08.216
- Yeah.
- From where, Nick? Huh?

25:08.967 --> 25:10.635
Sofia's been working this shit
for months.

25:11.594 --> 25:13.847
Take these to the truck.
Get this shit.

25:14.472 --> 25:16.433
Crank up the heat.
Keep 'em warm.

25:20.562 --> 25:22.022
Put them in the back of the van.

25:22.022 --> 25:24.190
I'll start the engine
and turn on the heat.

25:24.983 --> 25:26.568
Mikey, tell me somethin' good.

25:27.068 --> 25:28.945
Mikey's dead, you little bitch.

25:30.447 --> 25:32.032
Thanks for the keys, Oz.

25:32.032 --> 25:34.617
I never coulda busted out
without 'em.

25:35.952 --> 25:37.871
You amateur piece of shit.

25:39.330 --> 25:41.750
There's no place
I can't find you now.

25:42.542 --> 25:43.835
No place, Oz!

25:45.628 --> 25:46.880
You are cooked.

25:46.880 --> 25:48.256
Cooked, huh?

25:50.050 --> 25:50.967
That's funny.

25:51.718 --> 25:52.886
Do me a favor, Sal.

25:53.595 --> 25:54.554
Call your wife.

25:55.180 --> 25:56.306
See if she answers.

26:00.018 --> 26:02.103
You stole
from the wrong fucking guy.

26:06.941 --> 26:08.068
Fuck.

26:18.370 --> 26:20.121
- Oz.
- How is she?

26:20.747 --> 26:22.999
Yeah, no,
she's-she's... she's...

26:23.833 --> 26:24.709
She's f--

26:24.709 --> 26:26.127
Vic, how is she?!

26:26.127 --> 26:28.129
She's fine.
She's just-- She's sleeping.

26:29.964 --> 26:31.216
When you gonna be here?

26:33.760 --> 26:35.470
Look, I got a lotta heat on me.

26:35.470 --> 26:36.596
So...

26:39.099 --> 26:41.726
I need you to get my ma
outta there, alright?

26:41.726 --> 26:43.019
There's a go bag in the kitchen.

26:43.019 --> 26:45.063
It's behind the vent,
in the pantry.

26:45.063 --> 26:47.065
Take it and whatever else
you can get. Her meds.

26:47.065 --> 26:49.609
Don't forget her fucking meds!
She ain't gonna like it much.

26:49.609 --> 26:51.486
- You seen how she can get.
- Wh...

26:52.862 --> 26:54.614
- What happened?
- Goddammit, Vic!

26:54.614 --> 26:55.990
Just do it, alright?

26:56.783 --> 26:59.119
W-Well, where do we go?

27:03.498 --> 27:04.541
I don't know.

27:06.334 --> 27:09.879
It's gotta be somewhere
where nobody'd think to look.

27:09.879 --> 27:11.297
You know?

27:11.297 --> 27:13.842
Just... Just get in the car.

27:14.426 --> 27:15.385
Right? Just drive.

27:15.385 --> 27:17.637
Okay, yeah.
I'll-I'll-I'll-I'll...

27:18.555 --> 27:19.973
I'll find a place that's safe.

27:19.973 --> 27:22.726
And I'll call you
when I get there, alright?

27:23.268 --> 27:24.978
- Yeah, good, good.
- Okay. Hey, Oz.

27:26.229 --> 27:28.314
I got this, okay?

27:30.483 --> 27:31.943
I'm gonna take care of her.

27:32.485 --> 27:33.611
Yeah, you do that.

27:57.260 --> 27:58.261
Yes?

28:02.724 --> 28:03.683
Sofia...

28:15.570 --> 28:16.905
What are you doing here?

28:19.908 --> 28:21.159
The police came to me,

28:21.910 --> 28:23.203
asking about you.

28:25.997 --> 28:27.248
I didn't say anything.

28:28.583 --> 28:29.876
What do you want, Julian?

28:30.502 --> 28:32.337
Because I'm in the middle
of something,

28:32.337 --> 28:34.798
and I think we're past the point
of analysis, don't you?

28:36.549 --> 28:37.634
Yes.

28:39.427 --> 28:40.470
You're right.

28:43.264 --> 28:44.766
And you were right about me.

28:48.186 --> 28:49.646
But it's not the control I miss.

28:52.357 --> 28:53.733
When I saw what happened
on the news,

28:53.733 --> 28:54.818
I knew it was you.

28:56.945 --> 28:58.738
That you did what you had to do.

29:00.573 --> 29:01.908
I can already see it,

29:02.742 --> 29:03.868
what it's given you.

29:05.662 --> 29:06.788
The release.

29:09.874 --> 29:11.501
And I'd like to feel that, too.

29:12.836 --> 29:13.920
With you.

29:16.548 --> 29:18.550
I'd like to be a part
of whatever's next...

29:22.137 --> 29:23.638
if you'll have me.

29:38.778 --> 29:39.821
Hey!

29:40.947 --> 29:42.282
Quiet the fuck down.

29:44.784 --> 29:46.411
The lady's got something to say.

30:02.469 --> 30:04.220
Thank you, Johnny.

30:06.973 --> 30:07.932
Sit down.

30:14.689 --> 30:17.692
First, I'd like to address
the elephant in the room.

30:19.361 --> 30:20.904
I gassed the Family.

30:20.904 --> 30:23.031
Oh, Jesus Christ.

30:26.868 --> 30:28.370
I killed them all.

30:30.455 --> 30:31.498
And I am

30:32.374 --> 30:34.000
so glad

30:34.709 --> 30:35.627
that they're dead.

30:37.003 --> 30:41.049
My family disposed of my mother
like she was nothing.

30:41.049 --> 30:43.134
Then they did the same to me.

30:44.219 --> 30:45.178
And honestly,

30:47.013 --> 30:48.056
none of you

30:48.848 --> 30:50.100
are any different.

30:52.352 --> 30:54.896
None of you are made men.

30:56.272 --> 30:57.732
Except for Johnny here.

31:01.069 --> 31:02.112
The rest of you...

31:05.532 --> 31:06.825
You're pawns.

31:08.743 --> 31:09.994
You're overlooked.

31:11.162 --> 31:12.372
Expendable.

31:15.750 --> 31:19.212
My mother was Isabella Gigante.

31:20.755 --> 31:22.966
Few spoke of her after she died,

31:23.717 --> 31:26.094
because she was a force

31:26.928 --> 31:30.515
greater than the Falcones
could handle.

31:33.101 --> 31:34.227
As of today,

31:35.061 --> 31:37.439
my father's legacy is dead,

31:37.439 --> 31:41.609
and we will never speak
his name again.

31:42.235 --> 31:43.987
From this point on,

31:45.238 --> 31:46.906
I am a Gigante,

31:47.907 --> 31:50.493
and this is a new Family now.

31:50.493 --> 31:51.995
What are you doing?

31:51.995 --> 31:56.583
A family that will not treat you
like cannon fodder

31:56.583 --> 31:59.544
in a fruitless war
against the Maronis.

31:59.544 --> 32:01.421
A war which I intend to end.

32:01.421 --> 32:03.048
Alright, okay, Sofia.

32:04.215 --> 32:06.718
Let's not be rash here, alright?
These gentlemen know

32:06.718 --> 32:08.303
we got a score
we need to settle--

32:27.322 --> 32:28.198
This.

32:29.199 --> 32:30.492
This was my father's.

32:31.493 --> 32:33.620
But he made it
off of your labor.

32:34.829 --> 32:37.415
You did the dirty work,

32:38.291 --> 32:40.543
and they kept it all
for themselves.

32:43.421 --> 32:44.839
If you join me,

32:46.633 --> 32:48.635
you will have a new Family.

32:50.470 --> 32:53.348
And I will pay you
what you're worth.

32:53.973 --> 32:56.559
More money than
you've ever seen before.

33:13.451 --> 33:14.411
Ms. Gigante?

33:22.085 --> 33:23.044
Go ahead.

33:55.618 --> 33:56.911
Why are we here?

33:57.495 --> 33:59.622
You said Oswald was takin' over.

34:00.331 --> 34:02.250
Yeah, he is, but...

34:02.375 --> 34:04.502
He said things
with the Maronis got messy,

34:04.502 --> 34:08.173
and that we should go somewhere
no one would think to look.

34:08.798 --> 34:09.924
All right, let's go.

34:10.884 --> 34:12.469
Clean 'em out. Take everything.

34:12.469 --> 34:14.971
Whatever's left
in this fucking shithole.

34:19.642 --> 34:21.811
No one really cares
about Crown Point, so...

34:38.328 --> 34:39.537
Ain't this nice.

34:40.580 --> 34:42.123
VIP parkin'.

34:42.123 --> 34:44.292
We're gonna smash
this shit right here.

34:46.252 --> 34:47.879
Make sure you grab
everything that's left.

34:47.879 --> 34:49.172
Don't leave nothin' in there.

34:49.172 --> 34:51.299
Clean the whole
fuckin' place out.

34:55.220 --> 34:56.346
Shit.

35:01.768 --> 35:03.061
Hey. Whoa.

35:03.895 --> 35:05.689
Don't let 'em see you, okay?
Come on.

35:08.983 --> 35:10.318
Come on. Come on.

35:11.403 --> 35:13.571
- Come on.
- What did he do to you?

35:14.531 --> 35:16.199
You're practically
pissin' yourself.

35:16.199 --> 35:17.701
Please. Shut up. Shut up.
Shut up.

35:17.701 --> 35:19.327
Come here, come on.

35:19.327 --> 35:20.578
Come on, come on, come on.

35:24.541 --> 35:25.500
Please.

35:26.459 --> 35:27.544
His name...

35:28.253 --> 35:29.504
His name is S-Squid.

35:29.504 --> 35:31.047
He's a bad guy.

35:31.047 --> 35:34.009
He runs Drops and all
the other stuff in this area.

35:35.176 --> 35:36.594
Listen, Francis.

35:36.594 --> 35:38.596
We gotta get off of the street
right now, okay?

35:39.389 --> 35:41.099
That's where we're headed.
You ready?

35:46.187 --> 35:48.064
Where are you takin' me?

35:48.064 --> 35:49.899
My friend Calvin's apartment.

35:51.234 --> 35:52.527
He used to live here.

35:52.527 --> 35:53.862
Watch your step.

35:53.862 --> 35:55.572
It's been condemned.

35:56.906 --> 35:57.991
Come on.

36:27.854 --> 36:29.230
No lights, huh?

36:31.733 --> 36:32.650
Yeah.

36:46.373 --> 36:47.415
Wow.

36:50.377 --> 36:51.836
What is it? What's wrong?

36:54.547 --> 36:57.175
This looks like the apartment
I had with my boys.

37:00.720 --> 37:01.930
I hate it here.

37:15.527 --> 37:16.945
I used to live over there.

37:20.532 --> 37:22.659
The Eastside is cursed.

37:27.956 --> 37:29.874
It takes everything from you.

37:48.935 --> 37:50.103
You alone?

37:50.103 --> 37:51.146
What's wrong?

37:56.526 --> 37:58.987
Oz, baby.
What have they done to you?

38:00.613 --> 38:02.782
- Hey. Hey. Okay.
- Come here.

38:02.782 --> 38:04.659
It's okay. It's okay.

38:04.659 --> 38:06.411
Alright, get your things.

38:06.411 --> 38:07.620
Come on.

38:08.621 --> 38:10.623
We gotta lay low.
Vic's already in Crown Point.

38:10.623 --> 38:12.083
He's got us a nice spot
by the Zoo.

38:12.083 --> 38:13.543
Crown Point?
What are you talking about?

38:13.543 --> 38:15.086
I know it ain't perfect.

38:15.086 --> 38:16.963
It's the only place
Sal and Sofia got no pull.

38:16.963 --> 38:18.506
Sal? Oh my God, Oz.

38:18.506 --> 38:20.800
There's something else.
Before we go, I gotta tell ya.

38:20.800 --> 38:22.510
It ain't just me and Vic, alright?

38:22.510 --> 38:23.678
Yeah, but, Oz.

38:23.678 --> 38:25.889
I'm not--
I'm not going with you.

38:27.766 --> 38:28.850
I can't.

38:29.559 --> 38:31.394
I thought we was
in this together.

38:32.937 --> 38:35.190
Un-fuckin'-believable,
you're doing this right now.

38:36.399 --> 38:38.193
Where you gonna go, huh?

38:38.193 --> 38:40.820
You got some high roller
you'd rather shack up with, huh?

38:40.820 --> 38:42.405
- For the money?
- Oz. Baby.

38:42.405 --> 38:43.615
We had a deal.

38:44.366 --> 38:46.951
We look out for each other.
We don't fuck each other over.

38:47.702 --> 38:49.204
That's why this worked.

38:49.788 --> 38:50.705
It ain't--

38:52.332 --> 38:54.125
After everything I done for you?

38:54.125 --> 38:56.086
It ain't fucking workin'
no more?

38:56.086 --> 38:59.381
Huh? After everything
I fucking done for you?

38:59.381 --> 39:01.257
Jesus fucking Christ!

39:02.425 --> 39:03.718
Fuck.

39:03.718 --> 39:05.387
I'm a fuckin' idiot!

39:06.513 --> 39:08.431
- Fuckin' dumb.
- Okay, okay.

39:08.431 --> 39:11.184
- Stupid. Stupid.
- No, no, no, no, no, no.

39:12.686 --> 39:14.187
You're onto something, baby.

39:18.566 --> 39:21.236
I know you gonna be
on top again soon.

39:29.536 --> 39:30.954
You know I'm yours.

39:33.957 --> 39:35.458
But right now, I'm just...

39:35.458 --> 39:37.168
I'm just gonna hold you back.

40:00.483 --> 40:02.152
Shit! Around the back!

40:18.251 --> 40:20.795
Freedom always comes at a cost,
doesn't it?

40:24.674 --> 40:25.884
Sit down, Salvatore.

40:33.683 --> 40:35.226
What a funky hideout.

40:40.523 --> 40:42.108
Big fan of wood, I see.

40:46.112 --> 40:47.739
Oh, Antonucci's.

40:48.406 --> 40:50.492
That doesn't look like
it traveled well.

40:56.373 --> 40:58.833
My father always said
you were too sentimental,

40:59.668 --> 41:00.835
that it made you weak.

41:02.754 --> 41:04.297
I don't think he understood

41:05.048 --> 41:07.759
why you cared so much
about your family.

41:08.468 --> 41:11.304
That's because
you Falcones eat your own.

41:12.764 --> 41:15.141
Your family had it right,
I think.

41:17.435 --> 41:18.520
Ten years ago,

41:18.520 --> 41:19.813
some measly driver

41:20.397 --> 41:22.232
spun a bullshit story about me.

41:23.149 --> 41:24.651
He betrayed me,

41:24.651 --> 41:26.361
the daughter of the Falcone Don,

41:26.361 --> 41:28.363
and he got rewarded for it.

41:29.280 --> 41:30.782
And now here we are.

41:32.325 --> 41:35.453
Both of us suffering
at the hands of that same man.

41:38.289 --> 41:39.416
But you...

41:42.002 --> 41:43.670
Would you have let that stand?

41:46.131 --> 41:49.467
I woulda ripped out his tongue
and left him for the vultures.

41:49.467 --> 41:50.969
That's what I thought.

41:55.724 --> 41:58.018
I'm very sorry about your wife
and son, Salvatore.

41:58.018 --> 42:00.186
Why are you here?
What do you want?

42:00.854 --> 42:03.606
I've come here to end the war
between our Families.

42:14.868 --> 42:16.369
I'm not gonna kill you.

42:17.328 --> 42:18.246
Why?

42:20.040 --> 42:22.167
Because it's what Oz wants.

42:23.501 --> 42:24.878
Falcones and Maronis have been--

42:24.878 --> 42:27.589
The Falcones
don't exist anymore.

42:28.548 --> 42:30.342
I am offering you an alliance.

42:31.426 --> 42:32.761
We join our families,

42:32.761 --> 42:35.180
the Maronis and the Gigantes,

42:35.889 --> 42:37.515
as a show of strength.

42:39.059 --> 42:40.018
We kill Oz.

42:41.019 --> 42:42.645
And then we take over the city.

42:45.398 --> 42:46.274
Together.

44:00.181 --> 44:01.891
Oswald...

44:07.647 --> 44:08.940
I'm sorry, Ma.

44:09.858 --> 44:11.484
I feel like I let you down.

44:12.777 --> 44:13.778
You did.

44:18.241 --> 44:19.659
This place is temporary.

44:19.659 --> 44:20.702
I got...

44:21.703 --> 44:23.705
I just gotta figure out
my next move.

44:24.789 --> 44:25.707
Yep.

44:26.875 --> 44:28.043
My boy...

44:28.918 --> 44:30.670
With such big dreams.

44:32.380 --> 44:33.548
Like your father.

44:35.467 --> 44:36.718
No, Ma.

44:38.428 --> 44:39.763
I ain't like him.

44:40.722 --> 44:42.057
I can fix this.

44:44.309 --> 44:46.478
It's you and me
under one roof now.

44:47.145 --> 44:48.480
Like it used to be.

44:52.942 --> 44:54.361
Are you're tryin' to kill me?

44:55.320 --> 44:57.072
No, Ma,
I'm tryin' to protect you.

45:00.492 --> 45:01.743
It's better this way,

45:02.577 --> 45:03.787
when we're together.

45:04.496 --> 45:05.747
Takin' me back here,

45:07.165 --> 45:08.875
you're throwin' it in my face...

45:09.918 --> 45:11.252
what I lost.

45:16.257 --> 45:17.509
I lost 'em too.

45:27.560 --> 45:30.313
What kind of man can't take care
of his own mother?

45:32.065 --> 45:33.191
Get off.

45:38.488 --> 45:39.614
Get off!

46:11.896 --> 46:13.064
I'm awake.

46:13.064 --> 46:14.149
Hey.

46:14.983 --> 46:15.984
Fuck. Oz...

46:16.776 --> 46:19.612
Shit. I fell asleep.
Alright, I'm--

46:19.612 --> 46:20.739
Stop.

46:25.577 --> 46:26.661
You did good, kid.

46:29.205 --> 46:31.249
I know you don't wanna be
here neither.

46:31.249 --> 46:32.417
It was a smart move.

46:33.293 --> 46:34.544
Crown Point.

46:48.141 --> 46:49.976
Told her I'd get her
a penthouse.

46:51.853 --> 46:53.063
The best view in the city.

46:53.772 --> 46:56.274
She s-said that you guys

46:56.274 --> 46:59.110
kinda lived near here?

47:00.111 --> 47:01.738
Two-bedroom walk-up.

47:03.823 --> 47:05.950
Looked a helluva lot
like this fuckin' dump.

47:14.793 --> 47:16.127
This was Jack's.

47:17.629 --> 47:18.838
Benny didn't play ball.

47:21.216 --> 47:22.634
What happened to 'em?

47:27.889 --> 47:28.973
To your brothers?

47:33.561 --> 47:34.688
The city took 'em.

47:36.856 --> 47:38.358
Just like it took your family.

47:41.403 --> 47:43.154
There was nothin' I could...

47:45.365 --> 47:46.700
I was...

47:48.993 --> 47:49.994
too weak.

47:54.958 --> 47:57.585
My brothers and me, we used to
get into all kinds of trouble.

48:02.090 --> 48:04.259
Back then, when we was kids,

48:04.259 --> 48:05.969
we just had the city, you know?

48:07.262 --> 48:08.596
That was our playground.

48:29.868 --> 48:30.702
Hey, kid.

48:31.494 --> 48:32.620
Let's go.

48:34.664 --> 48:36.708
You ever heard
of the underground trolleys?

48:36.708 --> 48:38.251
Used to run here.

48:38.251 --> 48:39.336
No.

49:25.799 --> 49:28.968
Me and my brothers, we used to
mess around down here a lot.

49:29.719 --> 49:31.513
These tunnels,
they go everywhere.

49:32.764 --> 49:35.058
Gave us access
to the whole damn city.

49:36.226 --> 49:37.060
Come on.

49:37.060 --> 49:39.396
How long have these been here?

49:39.396 --> 49:41.106
They were abandoned
when I was a kid.

49:41.106 --> 49:43.066
Politicians got greedy.

49:43.066 --> 49:44.359
Diverted funds.

49:44.359 --> 49:46.361
One day, the trolleys
just stopped runnin'.

50:03.378 --> 50:04.546
Wow...

50:05.880 --> 50:06.881
Long time.

50:12.137 --> 50:13.888
Wow. Holy shit.

50:13.888 --> 50:15.515
Fuckin' unbelievable, right?

50:49.007 --> 50:50.342
Whoa...

50:56.681 --> 50:58.058
It's gonna take some work,

50:58.058 --> 50:59.642
you know, to get it into shape,

51:00.727 --> 51:01.978
but once we do...

51:03.521 --> 51:04.564
Hey, kid!

51:05.315 --> 51:06.566
You feel that, right?

51:07.317 --> 51:09.277
It's humid down here, dark.

51:09.277 --> 51:11.363
You know what thrives
in a place like this?

51:12.405 --> 51:14.366
- Mushrooms?
- Bingo.

51:16.076 --> 51:17.619
Yeah, mushrooms.

51:19.287 --> 51:21.498
Welcome to our new
base of operations.

51:23.583 --> 51:24.751
This fuckin' place...

51:27.295 --> 51:28.505
callin' me home.
